<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net461;netstandard2.0;net6.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <Version>1.0.0.3-beta-01</Version>
    <InfomationalVersion>1.0.0.3</InfomationalVersion>
    <PackageId>Fanex.Betlist.Jili</PackageId>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Support new Gaming API (#200105)</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Description>
New bet list for Jili

The result link should call this Javascript function: "showJiliBetDetails(transId, 'winlostDate', custId, transactionType);", which transactionType is:

- 1, if the status is Won, Lose, Draw, or Refund

- 2, if the status is Reject, or Void

- 3, if the status is Running, or Waiting

- otherwise, 0

The [Result] links in [Status] column take the following parameters:

ViewResult(matchId, race, betTypeId, sportTypeId, refNo, 'userName', 'winlostDate', refNo_MixParlay, leagueId, isoutright, CurrencyId, 'GameId3rd', custId, 'TransId3rd', 'SiteId', 'Transdesc');
    </Description>
    <GenerateAssemblyInfo>true</GenerateAssemblyInfo>
    <Authors>Nexcel Solutions</Authors>
    <PackageTags>Fanex BetList Jili</PackageTags>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://nexdev.net/projects/p111058/wiki/012023_-_Jili_-_Product_Overview</PackageProjectUrl>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="TplNetCore" Version="1.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Fanex.BetList.Core\Fanex.BetList.Core.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Fanex.BetList.RNGCore\Fanex.BetList.RNGCore.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
